[b]Support statuses[/b]
[*][b]Detected:[/b] Model identification works, but telemetry and layout are not validated.
[*][b]Experimental:[/b] A profile exists, but real-hardware validation is incomplete.
[*][b]Community Validated:[/b] A real user has validated the applicable physical mapping, port selection, LEDs, link/speed behaviour, PoE, optical positions, sensors and rendered alignment.
[*][b]Confirmed:[/b] Repeatably tested and treated as officially supported.

[b]Exact-model policy[/b]
Each hardware SKU receives its own entry. No aliases are used to infer support for related variants.
